le><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/german-bond-haven-trade-shifts-as-investors-turn-to-asset-swaps</link><description>投资者正在改变德国政府债券的交易方式，德国政府债券是欧洲在压力时期的首选避风港。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/german-bond-haven-trade-shifts-as-investors-turn-to-asset-swaps'&gt;随着投资者转向资产互换，德国债券避风港交易发生变化&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：German Bond Haven Trade Shifts as Investors Turn to Asset Swaps&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/german-bond-haven-trade-shifts-as-investors-turn-to-asset-swaps</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:52:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 南非 IDC 正在洽谈收购糖业公司 2.57 亿美元的股份</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/south-africa-s-idc-in-talks-for-257-million-stake-in-sugar-firm</link><description>南非最大的发展金融机构计划以 45 亿兰特（2.57 亿美元）的价格收购一家投资公司的股份，该公司正在寻求收购南非最大的甜味剂精炼商 Tongaat Hulett Sugar SA Ltd. 的股份。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/south-africa-s-idc-in-talks-for-257-million-stake-in-sugar-firm'&gt;南非 IDC 正在洽谈收购糖业公司 2.57 亿美元的股份&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：South Africa’s IDC in Talks for $257 Million Stake in Sugar Firm&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/south-africa-s-idc-in-talks-for-257-million-stake-in-sugar-firm</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:55:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 特朗普试图削弱华为。现在它是中国人工智能的核心推。</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/business/huawei-trump-china-ai.html</link><description>随着中国获得英伟达先进芯片的机会减少，尽管华为与美国竞争对手存在巨大技术差距，但它对北京来说变得越来越不可或缺。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/business/huawei-trump-china-ai.html'&gt;特朗普试图削弱华为。现在它是中国人工智能的核心推。&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump Tried to Cripple Huawei. Now It Is Central to China’s A.I. Push.&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/business/huawei-trump-china-ai.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:01:56 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 两党都希望监管人工智能在国会面临障碍</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/politics/ai-regulation-congress-nvidia.html</link><description>两党成员均表示，他们希望解决人工智能政策问题，但立法步伐缓慢和地盘之争可能会成为障碍。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/politics/ai-regulation-congress-nvidia.html'&gt;两党都希望监管人工智能在国会面临障碍&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Bipartisan Desire to Regulate A.I. Faces Obstacles in Congress&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/politics/ai-regulation-congress-nvidia.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:03:47 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 罗马尼亚极右翼领导人西蒙被控煽动暴力</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/romanian-far-right-leader-simion-charged-with-inciting-violence</link><description>罗马尼亚极右翼领导人乔治·西蒙 (George Simion) 因涉嫌在去年竞争激烈的 2024 年总统选举后敦促对选举局法官使用暴力而被检察官指控公开煽动。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/romanian-far-right-leader-simion-charged-with-inciting-violence'&gt;罗马尼亚极右翼领导人西蒙被控煽动暴力&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Romanian Far-Right Leader Simion Charged With Inciting Violence&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/romanian-far-right-leader-simion-charged-with-inciting-violence</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:49:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] Coris 旗下科特迪瓦银行部门计划首次公开募股 (IPO)，力争跻身前五名</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/coris-ivory-coast-bank-unit-plans-ipo-in-push-for-top-five</link><description>Coris Holding SA 的科特迪瓦子公司计划进行 627 亿非洲法郎（1.05 亿美元）的首次公开募股，该银行寻求扩大其投资者基础并打入该国前五家银行。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/coris-ivory-coast-bank-unit-plans-ipo-in-push-for-top-five'&gt;Coris 旗下科特迪瓦银行部门计划首次公开募股 (IPO)，力争跻身前五名&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Coris’ Ivory Coast Bank Unit Plans IPO in Push for Top Five&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/coris-ivory-coast-bank-unit-plans-ipo-in-push-for-top-five</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:49:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 华尔街从人工智能的狂热转向悲观</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/wall-street-flips-from-ai-euphoria-to-gloom</link><description>美国股市多年来从未如此波动过。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/wall-street-flips-from-ai-euphoria-to-gloom'&gt;华尔街从人工智能的狂热转向悲观&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Wall Street Flips From AI Euphoria to Gloom&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/wall-street-flips-from-ai-euphoria-to-gloom</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:56:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] Couche-Tard 认为 Zabka 模式已扩展到波兰和罗马尼亚以外的地区</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/couche-tard-sees-zabka-model-expanding-beyond-poland-romania</link><description>Alimentation Couche-Tard Inc. 计划将 Zabka Group SA 的便利店模式带入更多欧洲市场，因为这家加拿大零售商准备完成其有史以来最大的收购。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/couche-tard-sees-zabka-model-expanding-beyond-poland-romania'&gt;Couche-Tard 认为 Zabka 模式已扩展到波兰和罗马尼亚以外的地区&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Couche-Tard Sees Zabka Model Expanding Beyond Poland, Romania&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/couche-tard-sees-zabka-model-expanding-beyond-poland-romania</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC] 危机规划中资本争夺加剧，瑞士最大银行将与立法者摊牌</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/ubs-swiss-capital-rules-finma-crisis-plan.html</link><description>瑞士监管机构FINMA表示，瑞银可以执行其首选的危机解决策略，尽管该银行面临着议会就更严格的资本要求进行的单独斗争。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/ubs-swiss-capital-rules-finma-crisis-plan.html'&gt;危机规划中资本争夺加剧，瑞士最大银行将与立法者摊牌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Switzerland’s biggest bank set for showdown with lawmakers as capital fight intensifies amid crisis planning&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/26/ubs-swiss-capital-rules-finma-crisis-plan.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:17:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 马来西亚称如果亚航财务困境恶化可能会进行干预</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen</link><description>第二财政部长阿米尔·哈姆扎·阿齐赞表示，如果亚洲航空集团有限公司的财务困难恶化，马来西亚可能会考虑介入支持该公司，因为政府寻求保护国内航空连通性。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen'&gt;马来西亚称如果亚航财务困境恶化可能会进行干预&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Malaysia Says May Intervene If AirAsia’s Financial Woes Worsen&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:22:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] AlexForbes 资产达到 450 亿美元后出现更多增长</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/alexforbes-sees-more-growth-after-assets-hit-45-billion</link><description>南非最大的商业退休基金管理机构上半年管理资产增加了 13%，预计今年剩余时间将保持这一速度。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/alexforbes-sees-more-growth-after-assets-hit-45-billion'&gt;AlexForbes 资产达到 450 亿美元后出现更多增长&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：AlexForbes Sees More Growth After Assets Hit $45 Billion&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/alexforbes-sees-more-growth-after-assets-hit-45-billion</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:28:44 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>